{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-77","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If from a straight line there be subtracted a straight line which is incommensurable in square with the whole, and which with the whole makes the sum of the squares on them medial, but twice the rectangle contained by them rational, the remainder is irrational: and let it be called that which produces with a rational area a medial whole.","book":10,"number":77,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.77","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.77/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":77,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-77@raw-1dfd73d0dd1659d3","contentId":"euclid-10-77","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1dfd73d0dd1659d3d823a5aa20417a21b4d5bf1e43c964cc556b1a10543d886a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-77.statement","euclid-10-77.proof.1","euclid-10-77.proof.2","euclid-10-77.proof.3","euclid-10-77.conclusion","euclid-10-77.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-77.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-77","revisionId":"euclid-10-77@raw-1dfd73d0dd1659d3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f4f889f97e67a5cbed6072c43a08361449814b1039624165efde5f7d2590e59","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a straight line there be subtracted a straight line which is incommensurable in square with the whole, and which with the whole makes the sum of the squares on them medial, but twice the rectangle contained by them rational, the remainder is irrational: and let it be called that which produces with a rational area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从一条直线中减去一条直线,即整条线正方形,中项无理线段,整条直线正方形,但比有理的正方形增加了一倍,其余的无理:用有理面积/中项无理线段整条直线称为；上述对应量不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-77.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-77","revisionId":"euclid-10-77@raw-1dfd73d0dd1659d3","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"570e4fc50e81d32bdcc4988519a0cade3c5cd703c3977074abbbd85d84181095","citations":["euclid-10-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the straight line AB let there be subtracted the straight line BC which is incommensurable in square with AB and fulfils the given conditions; [[X. 34](/principles/euclid-10-34)] I say that the remainder AC is the irrational straight line aforesaid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将直线 AB减去直线 BC,即正方形不可公度,加上第AB,满足了规定的条件;我说,其余的AC是上述第无理线段。 [[X. 34](/principles/euclid-10-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-77.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-77","revisionId":"euclid-10-77@raw-1dfd73d0dd1659d3","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b631225e1bd07cab0fba9c9f4e44f69171461cc573ced939a20a7ca01410d6f3","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the sum of the squares on AB, BC is medial, while twice the rectangle AB, BC is rational, therefore the squares on AB, BC are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC; therefore the remainder also, the square on AC, is incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7), X. 16]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB正方形的总数为中项无理线段,而矩形AB的两倍,BC有理,因此,AB正方形不可公度,是不可公度AB的两倍;因此,AC正方形BC,是不可公度ABBC的两倍;因此,其余的正方形AC不可公度,是矩形ABBC,是X1月2日X。 ] [ [II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-77.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-77","revisionId":"euclid-10-77@raw-1dfd73d0dd1659d3","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29c5bedacbf5ce04dbd81b665b5564225e3df8047501300ce9e97816a6d1910b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And twice the rectangle AB, BC is rational; therefore the square on AC is irrational; therefore AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形 AB,BC是有理的两倍,因此AC的正方形是无理,AC是无理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-77.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-77","revisionId":"euclid-10-77@raw-1dfd73d0dd1659d3","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f5ce55657e83d0579f76f58d56c58aaf65372029838db1cf20f51370d82862f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called that which produces with a rational area a medial whole. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"Q,E,D, 以有理面积a中项无理线段整件生产"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-77.source","contentId":"euclid-10-77","revisionId":"euclid-10-77@raw-1dfd73d0dd1659d3","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2e5e78c317d817e50d60e6aceb78560d1ed976aff9cd7c2840c3252b21c23df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.77/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.77\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93